Package: reservationpatterns
Type: Project
Title: Geographic Variation in Reservation Allocation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contact@gsood.com")
Description: Reproducible analyses of women's reservation transitions among
